sequenceDiagram
    participant Materializer as Reminder materializer
    participant DB as Notification outbox
    participant Route as Selected route
    participant Member as Member directory
    participant Template as Template renderer
    participant Provider

    Materializer->>DB: upsert intent with appointment version + reminder slot
    Route->>DB: claim ready row with lease + fencing token
    DB-->>Route: one logical notification
    Route->>Member: resolve current contact, language, consent
    Member-->>Route: current profile, memory only
    Route->>Template: render approved typed template
    Template-->>Route: provider request, memory only
    Route->>Provider: send with deterministic idempotency key
    Provider-->>Route: stable outcome
    Route->>DB: fenced terminal update + identifier redaction
    Route->>DB: bounded status-specific retention

    Note over Materializer,DB: Past catch-up window is suppressed as REMINDER_WINDOW_MISSED; never send late
